  {
   "id": 673633,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "Think back to your early childhood, particularly during the 'terrible twos' phase. If possible, ask your caregiver about how you managed your emotions during that time. Were you often irritable, or did you exhibit other strong emotions? Reflect on the levels of arousal and types of emotions you showed as an infant or toddler. How do you think these early emotional tendencies have influenced your emotional control today?",
